WEBVTT

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:11.050
<i>I was stuck in a hell where 
I didn't even know if I was</i>

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:12.800
<i>dead or alive.</i>

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:14.860
Pick up the pace!

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:18.970
<i>My body, which I had trained 
to its limits for this,</i>

00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:21.910
<i>the training that I relived in my dreams...</i>

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:24.710
<i>It was all for nothing.</i>

00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:28.610
Fire!

00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:30.340
Charge!

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:35.290
Shoot the enemy until the 
light in their eyes is gone!

00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:46.370
<i>It was all just a matter of luck. 
You either got shot or you didn't.</i>

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:59.530
<i>Most of the soldiers on that battlefield</i>

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:03.740
<i>didn't even get to think about that 
before their corpses started to rot.</i>

00:01:06.730 --> 00:01:09.160
<i>And within that hell...</i>

00:01:27.710 --> 00:01:31.800
<i>I was able to keep my life.</i>

00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:39.280
This definitely isn't going to be easy.

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:41.530
Well, that's basically the 
lifeline for their supplies.

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:43.500
If we can take it down, 
victory will be within reach.

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:45.370
Do you think we can do it?

00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:48.670
Of course! It's something only 
we Incarnates can do!

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:52.870
Let's end this war together.

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:53.930
Yes, sir!

00:01:53.930 --> 00:01:55.440
Watch my back out there!

00:01:55.440 --> 00:01:56.290
Roger!

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:03.770
<i>I became the wind that stormed 
through the battlefield,</i>

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:10.550
<i>and the captain's words always 
made me feel proud during battle.</i>

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:18.200
I...

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:21.030
This is the end.

00:02:27.350 --> 00:02:28.490
Humans?

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:33.000
Two Oaths

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:36.670
Hank? Hank?

00:04:39.860 --> 00:04:41.230
Elaine...

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:46.940
It looks like this is the end.

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:52.920
Was I able to keep my promise at all?

00:04:55.650 --> 00:04:56.810
Hank...

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:04.340
Hank! Hank!

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:05.280
Hank!

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:08.370
Schaal...

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:09.760
Yes!

00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:12.080
Thank goodness! You woke up.

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:13.850
Where am I?

00:05:14.340 --> 00:05:18.260
Am I... alive?

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:22.850
Schaal?! Why? You—

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:26.810
I can't blame you for being surprised.

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:42.430
Again?

00:05:43.060 --> 00:05:45.560
<i>How do they keep finding me?</i>

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:51.760
<i>It can't be by sound or smell...</i>

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:53.540
<i>They can see me!</i>

00:06:01.870 --> 00:06:07.230
<i>If they can see me,
 I just need to kill them up close!</i>

00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:10.630
Reporting, sir.

00:06:11.110 --> 00:06:13.430
We were able to corner our target,

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:16.340
but it fought back, 
resulting in massive casualties.

00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:17.000
How many?

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:21.420
Twelve dead so far, and we haven't yet
confirmed the number gravely injured.

00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:25.660
We're dealing with Incarnates... 
This will not go easily.

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:27.420
Tell all of our remaining soldiers

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:29.340
that we will go ahead as planned.

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:32.810
Even if the worst happens, do not hesitate.

00:06:32.810 --> 00:06:33.620
Yes, sir!

00:06:36.740 --> 00:06:38.880
Hurry! We don't have any time!

00:06:39.990 --> 00:06:41.340
What happened?

00:06:41.340 --> 00:06:43.650
Half of the extermination 
squad has been annihilated.

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:46.430
We're heading over immediately.

00:06:46.430 --> 00:06:48.390
Wait! What happened to Schaal?

00:06:48.390 --> 00:06:49.270
I'm not sure.

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:51.860
I'm going, too.

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:52.730
But...

00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:54.570
I've been trained with the equipment.

00:06:54.570 --> 00:06:56.300
I won't hold you guys back.

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:58.710
Have another orderly look after the major.

00:06:58.710 --> 00:07:00.530
There's no need.

00:07:01.470 --> 00:07:03.350
Take me with you.

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:04.190
Hey!

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:05.780
You need to stay in bed!

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:07.050
I've slept enough!

00:07:07.050 --> 00:07:08.890
There's no way you can move on your own yet!

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:13.200
And that's why I need your help,

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:15.370
Second Lieutenant Liza Renecastle!

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:20.540
I wanted nothing more than to 
exterminate all of the Incarnates,

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:22.800
but now I want to help my men.

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:26.010
I cannot let Coup de Grâce be destroyed!

00:07:26.010 --> 00:07:29.740
And of course, I can't let 
Schaal Bancroft die, either.

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:34.770
I see...

00:07:35.340 --> 00:07:36.840
Thank goodness.

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:40.980
The fact that you're alive is 
my only salvation right now.

00:07:47.220 --> 00:07:52.990
A little while after the incident at 
Whitechurch, I returned to my village.

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:57.160
Then Liza and the others showed up there, too.

00:07:57.160 --> 00:08:02.310
They were there to exterminate
 the Incarnate that had shown up nearby.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.960
That Incarnate was my father.

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:09.960
That's impossible!

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:12.830
I'm sure that I...

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:17.640
Liza didn't know how he 
came back to life, either.

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:23.020
When my father reappeared before me, 
he had no trace of humanity left.

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:26.190
He tried to attack the village.

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:32.780
Because of that, I shot my father.

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:34.960
You...

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:38.990
In that moment, I felt like I understood

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:44.960
how you must have felt when you 
pointed your gun at my father.

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:53.090
I wanted to make sure I got to tell you that,
if I ever had the chance to see you again.

00:08:57.710 --> 00:09:00.800
I... don't know anymore.

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:01.460
Huh?

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:07.260
Regardless of what you say... 
Are they truly going to forgive me?

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:11.900
Yet you say you're going to eliminate us 
in order to retain the squad's honor?!

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:13.470
Who do you think you are?!

00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:15.900
You can't save us!

00:09:17.840 --> 00:09:21.550
Are they truly being saved?

00:09:22.170 --> 00:09:23.730
Hank...

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:28.270
Will, as well as everyone 
else in the squad...

00:09:28.270 --> 00:09:30.760
They weren't Beasts.

00:09:31.140 --> 00:09:35.350
They were my comrades who fought 
alongside me, and they were all human.

00:09:36.270 --> 00:09:38.520
I know that for a fact.

00:09:39.650 --> 00:09:40.770
And that's why...

00:09:41.520 --> 00:09:42.790
That's exactly why...

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:46.340
I was able to lay them to rest as people.

00:09:47.030 --> 00:09:51.050
The oath we swore that day to remain human...

00:09:51.550 --> 00:09:55.230
Those who have lost their souls 
shall be slain by their own.

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:59.520
In order to keep that oath, I...

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:05.680
I killed my friends, who only wanted to live!

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:09.500
Do I really have the right to do this?

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:15.450
I can tell! The more I use my powers, 
the more I'm starting to lose myself!

00:10:15.450 --> 00:10:16.860
Maybe I'm...

00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:22.570
Maybe I'm a Beast now, too.

00:10:34.390 --> 00:10:35.710
Schaal...

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:40.650
Would you kill me?

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:48.360
I want to at least die with my 
memories of how they used to be.

00:11:04.020 --> 00:11:05.420
I'm sorry I asked.

00:11:10.710 --> 00:11:12.060
Hank?

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:16.020
I have to go finish things with Roy.

00:11:17.870 --> 00:11:19.390
You stay here.

00:11:25.390 --> 00:11:28.650
Schaal, I just have one request.

00:11:29.550 --> 00:11:33.250
Please don't forget about us.

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:48.600
Reporting, sir.

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:52.690
We've lost our target, and his 
attacks have also ceased.

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:56.160
Understood. But don't let down your guard.

00:11:56.160 --> 00:11:56.890
Yes, sir.

00:12:00.480 --> 00:12:02.080
He's nearby!

00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:17.310
You did well for humans.

00:12:17.310 --> 00:12:20.440
But no matter how in control a squad may be,

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:23.090
they're finished if I kill 
their commanding officer!

00:12:24.810 --> 00:12:28.690
I knew you'd come after me!

00:12:34.510 --> 00:12:36.810
You're going to get shot at this range.

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:38.470
Think you'll be able to survive?

00:12:38.470 --> 00:12:40.140
You're going to die, too!

00:12:40.670 --> 00:12:43.640
We can't have you 
underestimating Coup de Grâce.

00:12:44.020 --> 00:12:48.290
Once our plan is in motion, there'll be
no need for a commanding officer!

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:51.750
You fell for our trap,

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:53.350
you vile Beast.

00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:18.230
You worthless humans...

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:20.610
have no right...

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:25.230
to butt into our battle!

00:13:22.490 --> 00:13:25.790
This still wasn't enough 
to mortally wound him?

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:29.790
Die, human!

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:55.560
Sir, what are you doing here?

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:03.060
Sorry about this. He just wouldn't stay still.

00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:07.020
I knew you were going to try something rash.

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:09.780
Don't you dare do anything like this again!

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:13.070
This is not how I want my squad to be!

00:14:15.510 --> 00:14:16.830
Indeed...

00:14:17.230 --> 00:14:22.500
Nothing is more pathetic than an old 
soldier who wants to end his life.

00:14:28.740 --> 00:14:31.670
All Incarnates will eventually lose their souls.

00:14:32.230 --> 00:14:35.800
Before that happens... 
Before they become Beasts...

00:14:35.800 --> 00:14:37.690
I must slay them while they're still human.

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:42.260
That's my final duty as the 
Incarnate squad captain.

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:46.910
Are you planning to do 
this all on your own?

00:14:49.420 --> 00:14:56.620
<i>I couldn't even fathom the pain and fear 
Hank had held within this whole time.</i>

00:14:56.910 --> 00:15:01.460
The only ones who can understand Incarnates 
are those who share the same fate.

00:15:01.930 --> 00:15:04.170
<i>That may be true.</i>

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:05.830
<i>But...</i>

00:15:06.540 --> 00:15:09.690
Would you kill me?

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:11.800
<i>Even so...</i>

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:15.300
<i>I don't want Hank to die.</i>

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:18.340
<i>I don't want him to wish for death.</i>

00:15:18.820 --> 00:15:22.400
<i>I can't let that happen.</i>

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:37.150
I've lost too much blood.

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:43.300
Hank...

00:15:43.850 --> 00:15:45.920
I knew you were alive.

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:50.420
Or should I say... you're just not dead yet.

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:53.270
You're in one hell of a state yourself.

00:15:53.670 --> 00:15:56.100
Let's end this here.

00:15:56.100 --> 00:16:01.170
A coward like you isn't 
capable of finishing anything!

00:16:01.570 --> 00:16:03.070
We'll see about that.

00:16:03.070 --> 00:16:07.010
With you in that state, I'm pretty sure 
I can at least take you down with me.

00:16:09.950 --> 00:16:12.690
I have a future I need to pursue!

00:16:12.690 --> 00:16:14.460
Begone!

00:16:14.460 --> 00:16:17.750
You're just the past!

00:16:18.860 --> 00:16:21.900
<i>Past? That's right...</i>

00:16:21.900 --> 00:16:23.430
<i>I am the past.</i>

00:16:24.350 --> 00:16:29.600
<i>I continue to fight while still thinking 
about all of you from the past.</i>

00:16:31.320 --> 00:16:33.020
<i>This is more than enough.</i>

00:16:34.400 --> 00:16:36.260
<i>You did well...</i>

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:40.820
<i>Especially on your own.</i>

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:00.790
Schaal?

00:17:02.590 --> 00:17:06.650
You're undoubtedly human just like us, Hank.

00:17:07.490 --> 00:17:12.680
If you... If you do end up 
becoming a true Beast...

00:17:12.680 --> 00:17:17.410
If that ever happens, I will kill you!

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:22.840
I promise to kill you 
while you're still human.

00:17:25.740 --> 00:17:27.800
That is my oath!

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:39.830
So, Hank, please continue to 
slay your friends who have

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:42.250
lost their souls while they're still human.

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:44.520
In order to fulfill your oath,

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:48.290
you need to survive as long as you can!

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:54.790
What a thing for a mere child to say...

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:57.860
<i>I see...</i>

00:17:58.940 --> 00:18:01.470
<i>Maybe that's all I wanted.</i>

00:18:02.110 --> 00:18:05.890
<i>Someone's sympathy...</i>

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:09.170
You stupid little girl...

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:11.770
Stay out of our fight!

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:14.810
You know nothing about 
the days we lived through!

00:18:48.530 --> 00:18:50.230
Hank...

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:56.110
So now you need a little girl 
to watch your back, Hank?

00:18:56.110 --> 00:19:01.790
It seems like the old you is 
finally starting to come back!

00:19:45.440 --> 00:19:46.750
Hank...

00:19:46.750 --> 00:19:48.330
It's so intense.

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:52.910
So this is what a battle between 
Incarnates looks like?

00:19:53.340 --> 00:19:55.290
Sir, shall we make our move?

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:56.080
Just wait.

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:05.050
This is the end.

00:20:29.090 --> 00:20:32.150
Yes... This is how it's supposed to be...

00:20:32.150 --> 00:20:35.330
This is how you're supposed to be!

00:20:43.710 --> 00:20:51.730
To me, you were the light 
that shone on the battlefield.

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:56.400
You sure looked cool...

00:20:57.480 --> 00:21:00.320
On the battlefield, where there's 
only fear and despair...

00:21:00.320 --> 00:21:05.270
You have no idea how reassuring it 
was to know you always had my back.

00:21:05.730 --> 00:21:09.770
Aw, man, Captain...

00:21:10.530 --> 00:21:14.110
Just one more time... I want to...

00:21:15.110 --> 00:21:15.990
Roy.

00:21:38.170 --> 00:21:41.200
What was he like?

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:44.060
I want to remember him properly.

00:21:47.400 --> 00:21:52.540
Rex Brock. We all called him Roy.

00:21:53.220 --> 00:21:55.950
He was prouder than anyone 
else about our mission.

00:21:56.370 --> 00:21:58.370
He could always talk easily to everyone.

00:21:58.950 --> 00:22:01.240
He was the glue of our squad.

00:22:01.890 --> 00:22:05.680
Take a look at Will's daughter, Captain.

00:22:05.680 --> 00:22:07.590
I just know it.

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:10.870
She's gonna grow up to be 
a beautiful young woman.

00:22:13.640 --> 00:22:18.340
You two might've become really good friends.

00:23:19.970 --> 00:23:24.060
Now we can finally talk, Hank Henriette.

00:23:25.270 --> 00:23:27.620
Welcome to the front lines 
of the Northern Army.

00:23:27.620 --> 00:23:29.960
You're going to tell me everything you know.

00:23:29.960 --> 00:23:31.330
If that ever happens...

00:23:31.330 --> 00:23:32.380
Curse that surgeon.

00:23:32.380 --> 00:23:34.220
Hey, Captain.

00:23:35.490 --> 00:23:38.560
Do whatever it takes to make that fort fall.

00:23:36.970 --> 00:23:39.970
The Start of Troubles Ahead
